{"id":"1133a7264b20c603","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-morita-equivalence.md","title":"Definition — 几何理论的 Morita 等价","display":"Definition — 几何理论的 Morita 等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-morita-equivalence","aliases":["14-df-morita-equivalence"],"display":"Definition — 几何理论的 Morita 等价","depends_on":["[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-morita-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-morita-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 几何理论的 Morita 等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2\">\\(\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2\\)</span> 为各自已绑定签名上的有穷几何理论；分类拓扑斯见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsMoritaEquivalent}(\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2\\ (\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathbb T_1)\\land\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_2,\\mathbb T_2)\\land\\mathcal B_1\\simeq\\mathcal B_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsMoritaEquivalent}(\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2\\ (\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathbb T_1)\\land\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_2,\\mathbb T_2)\\land\\mathcal B_1\\simeq\\mathcal B_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是从原书分类普遍性质整理的后续术语，未伪称原书有“IX.8”编号。等价的是模型伪函子，必须带对逆像的伪自然相容，不能只逐拓扑斯任取模型范畴等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-theory-models","status":"resolved","id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2$ 为各自已绑定签名上的有穷几何理论；分类拓扑斯见 [[14-df-classifying-topos]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsMoritaEquivalent}(\\mathbb T_1,\\mathbb T_2)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2\\ (\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathbb T_1)\\land\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_2,\\mathbb T_2)\\land\\mathcal B_1\\simeq\\mathcal B_2).","display":true}],"bytes":1042,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morita-equivalence|Definition — 几何理论的 Morita 等价]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morita-equivalence]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morita-equivalence|Definition — 几何理论的 Morita 等价]]"}],"outgoing":["a76b2bc2c7b718cf","b995af55a8b210ce","c502117a84587a7c"]}